        <summary>
          <para>Unknown setting for domain encryption in the app.</para>
          <para>This is the default value returned by getDomainEncryptionMode(String) when not overridden. Network libraries should avoid performing any domain encryption and perform a standard TLS handshake, equivalent to DOMAIN_ENCRYPTION_MODE_DISABLED.</para>
